  "notable_quotes": [
    "Three new Zn-triazole-BDC coordination polymers were hydrothermally synthesized: Zn5(H2O)2(triazole)4(BDC)3·3.9H2O, Zn2(triazole)2(Htriazole)(BDC)·2.5H2O, and Zn4(H2O)2(triazole)4(BDC)2·14H2O.",
    "BDC is highlighted as a favored ligand because its dicarboxylates offer varied bonding modes while the phenyl ring adds structural rigidity.",
    "In structure 1, a long Zn1-O2 bond of 2.37 Å versus 2.02-2.07 Å for other Zn-O bonds indicates strong polyhedral distortion from chelating carboxylate binding."
  ],
